---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Estimator from "../components/Estimator.jsx";
---
<BaseLayout title="Travel With Ease | International travel, thoughtfully planned" description="Personalised international travel planning from Ghana, with clear guidance from first idea to take-off.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">From Ghana to anywhere</span><h1>See the world.<br/><em>Keep the ease.</em></h1><p>Personalised journeys, clear guidance and an agent who holds every moving piece together.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#plan">Plan my trip</a><a class="text-link" href="/destinations">Explore destinations →</a></div></div><div class="hero-art" role="img" aria-label="Abstract golden journey line crossing a deep navy globe"><div class="orbit"></div><div class="globe">ACC<br/><span>→</span><br/>WORLD</div></div></section>
  <section class="trust-strip" aria-label="Service strengths"><span>Personal itinerary</span><span>Ghana-based support</span><span>Clear trip guidance</span><span>Secure client portal</span></section>
  <section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">Travel, held beautifully</span><h2>More than a booking. A journey shaped around you.</h2><p>From a quiet anniversary escape to a full family adventure, we turn the details into one calm, considered plan.</p></section>
  <section class="services-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Discover</h3><p>Share the feeling, pace and places you have in mind.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Shape</h3><p>We build a thoughtful route and transparent estimate.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Travel</h3><p>Your approved itinerary stays close, even when you are offline.</p></article></section>
  <section id="plan" class="estimator-section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Start with a useful number</span><h2>What could your trip look like?</h2><p>Estimated prices are provided as a guide and may change due to availability, exchange rates, travel dates and supplier pricing. This is not a confirmed quotation.</p></div><Estimator client:load /></section>
  <section class="closing"><span class="eyebrow">Your next stamp starts here</span><h2>Let’s make the faraway feel simple.</h2><a class="button light" href="#plan">Plan with us</a></section>
</BaseLayout>
